  "job_B1.4.18_20251001_193232": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00d0\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes eard w\u00e6s on Iudea lande, Galileiscre scire, \u00fea \u00fea he her on life w\u00e6s, on \u00fe\u00e6re byrig \u00d0a ferde he geond eall \u00fe\u00e6re fores\u00e6dan scire, to eallum samnungum, symle l\u00e6rende \u00fe\u00e6t folc, & His hlisa \u00fea asprang to Sirian lande, ofer eall \u00fe\u00e6t rice, \u00fe\u00e6t is swi\u00fee rum land; & him man gebrohte \u00fea Nu seg\u00f0 us se godspellere \u00fee \u00feiss godspell gesette \u00fee nu gebira\u00f0 to \u00feissere m\u00e6ssan, MARCVS gehaten \u00d0a gebrohte man him to, tomiddes \u00feam folce, \u00e6nne dumne mann, & se w\u00e6s eac swilce deaf, & b\u00e6don He dyde \u00fea his fingras innto his earan, & mid his halwendan spatle hys tungan hrepode, & beseah to Hw\u00e6t \u00fea, sona wurdon his earan geopenode, & his tungan bend wear\u00f0 unbunden eac, & he rihtlice \u00d0a bebead se H\u00e6lend \u00feam \u00fee hine brohton \u00fe\u00e6t hi hit ne s\u00e6don nanum menn nateshwon; ac hi \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee \u00d0iss godspell is nu ges\u00e6d \u00feuss sceortlice on Englisc; nu wylle we geedl\u00e6can eft \u00fea ylcan word \u00fe\u00e6s Tirus & Sidon syndon twa burga, be \u00feam spr\u00e6c se H\u00e6lend on sumere stowe hwilon, \u00fea \u00fea he cidde He cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00fe\u00e6re byrig \u00fee hatte Corozaim, & to anre o\u00f0re byrig, Bethsaida gehaten, Wa \u00fee, Corozaim; Nu secge ic to so\u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t sumera \u00feinga by\u00fe l\u00e6sse wite on Domesd\u00e6g Tyro & Sidone \u00feonne eow sylf",
